{"id": "q001", "difficulty": "easy", "expected_outcome": "auto_resolve", "correct": true, "verified": true, "degraded": false, "tool_used": null, "llm_calls": 2, "features": {"top_meaning": 0.40395694971084595, "meaning_gap": 0.005127549171447754, "top_word": 1.1417938470840454, "word_gap": 1.1417938470840454}, "answer": "Refund aapke item ki quality check ke baad aapke original payment method par aayega.  \n\n- **Standard**: 5‑7 business days  \n- **UPI**: 2‑3 business days (usually faster)  \n- **Credit/Debit Card**: 10 business days tak lag sakta hai, bank par depend karta hai  \n- **Cash on Delivery**: aapke bank account mein transfer hoga (bank details chahiye hongi)  \n\nQuality check ke baad ye timeline follow hoti hai."}
